WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.803
I first learned about Garliboost
three years ago and was very pleased
with using it, although…

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:10.603
…I was skeptical at first.
I used Garliboost for respiratory
problems and inflammation.

00:00:10.603 --> 00:00:19.684
I also used it to support
respiratory health and for diarrhea.
It is very easy to administer.

00:00:19.684 --> 00:00:26.643
You can give it with water
or directly to the calf —
without any difficulty.

00:00:26.643 --> 00:00:34.164
You simply approach the calf —
and it is very straightforward.
Garliboost is easy to use.

00:00:34.164 --> 00:00:41.644
In my experience, it helped support
the calf’s weight gain
and overall condition.

00:00:41.644 --> 00:00:46.873
For various serious problems
in calves, I recommend
considering Garliboost.
